<title>USA: Jos. A Bank Clothiers Inc cuts Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>Jos. A Bank Clothiers Inc cuts Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPSTEAD, Md. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.08     loss	 $0.29</p>
<p> Net loss		     600     loss	 2,000</p>
<p> Revs			33,800		   41,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,800		    6,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q2 includes $400,000 restructuring charge for cost overruns associated with manufacture of formal wear. The company has discontinued this contract mmanufacturing.  </p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.05     loss	 $0.91</p>
<p> Net loss		     300     loss	 6,200</p>
<p> Revs			71,100		   85,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,800		    6,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended Aug 3 vs July 29.</p>
</text>
